==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|fr|râpé|(tabac) râpé|grated (tobacco)}}, [[Appendix:Glossary#past participle|past participle]] of {{m|fr|râper||to grate}}, from {{uder|en|fro|-}} ''rasper'' "to [[scrape]]"; of [[Germanic]] origin.

